+| Field | Meaning |
+|---|---|
+| `revisionId` | Server-assigned identifier for this revision |
+| `visitId` | Client-generated visit UUID |
+| `baseRevisionIds` | The revision(s) this one was edited from; empty for the creating revision |
+| `authorId` | The authenticated worker or coordinator who produced the payload |
+| `receivedAt` | Server receipt time |
+| `submissionId` | The stored submission this revision came from |
